cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Satellite Data Processing Toolkit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chan
    given-names: Chih-Yu
    email: alex870521@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alex870521/Satellite_S5P"
abstract: >-
  Python toolkit to download, grid and plot atmospheric satellite data from
  Sentinel-5P/TROPOMI, MODIS, GEMS and ERA5, with a unified footprint-supersampling
  L3 pipeline that regrids all sources onto one common degree grid.
keywords:
  - satellite remote sensing
  - Sentinel-5P
  - TROPOMI
  - GEMS
  - MODIS
  - air quality
  - regridding
